From 329f1b0cad4ff1d77ad4fbb1fc6bd5488da07241 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jono Airey <jonoairey@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Feb 2026 11:59:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add two-way trust content across all marketing pages

Update features, how-it-works, homepage, and all 5 original use case
pages to communicate the integrity check and tamper detection
capabilities. Features page now titled "Two-Way Document Trust" with
dedicated sections. How-it-works restructured into outgoing/incoming
flows. Homepage shows side-by-side workflow and 2 new feature cards.
Each use case page gains a solution card, benefit, workflow step, and
FAQ for incoming document verification.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
